Thank you for your support. We’ve been receiving a lot of suggestions from Resonancers today and we’re working hard on fixing the problems.

[b]Bug fixed:[/b]
1.Fixed the error that after obtaining Greedy Ice, Chomper had a chance to swallow huge-sized enemies;
2.Fixed the error that the Transfer function went wrong and stopped the game from proceeding;
3.Fixed the error that with interacting when NPCs, some actions caused the game to crash;
4.Fixed the error that some of the gamepad bottoms were missing;
5.Corrected the description of the difficulty system regarding playthroughs.
6.Other bug fixes.


